---
import { ChevronDown } from "lucide-react";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

// The planner is Retirement_Planner.html of github.com/mathiasboos/Calculators, fetched with the site's colours, fonts
// and Swedish as the default language by scripts/sync-pensionsplaneraren.mjs (a GitHub Action does it every hour). It
// is shown as it is, in a frame the height of the window: it has its own header, tabs and scrolling. The page does
// not show the file's version; the sync still writes it to src/data/pensionsplaneraren-source.json.
const app = "/pensionsplaneraren-app.html";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pensionsplaneraren – planera din pension år för år"
  description="Planera hela pensionen: tillgångar, utgifter, uttag per konto, scenarier och Monte Carlo, med svensk skatt. Gratis och räknar i webbläsaren."
  ogTitle="Pensionsplaneraren – Pensionslyft"
  ogDescription="Tillgångar, utgifter, uttag och scenarier år för år, med svensk skatt."
>
  <h1 class="sr-only">Pensionsplaneraren</h1>

  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
    <p>Planera hela pensionen: tillgångar, utgifter, uttag och scenarier. Allt räknas i din webbläsare.</p>
    <a href={app} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
      Öppna i eget fönster ↗
    </a>
  </div>

  <iframe
    src={app}
    title="Pensionsplaneraren"
    class="block h-[calc(100dvh-6.25rem)] min-h-[34rem] w-full border-y border-border bg-card"></iframe>
  <noscript>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      Pensionsplaneraren behöver JavaScript. Slå på det i webbläsaren, eller öppna <a href={app} class="underline">planeraren i eget fönster</a>.
    </p>
  </noscript>

  <!-- Folded by default. Swedish is the page's language; the English text is shown when the planner is in English
       (the visitor's choice is kept in localStorage "pensionslyft.planner.lang", as in SiteHeader.astro). -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-12">
    <details class="group" data-planner-about>
      <summary
        class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md py-2 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
      >
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">
          <span data-pl-lang="sv" lang="sv">Om Pensionsplaneraren</span>
          <span data-pl-lang="en" lang="en" hidden>About the Retirement planner</span>
        </h2>
        <ChevronDown className="size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" />
      </summary>
      <div data-pl-lang="sv" lang="sv" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
        <p>
          Pensionsplaneraren räknar fram din ekonomi år för år, från i dag till slutet av livet: lön och skatt, allmän
          pension och tjänstepension, sparande på ISK och i kapitalförsäkring, utgifter och uttag från varje konto. Du
          kan jämföra scenarier och pröva planen mot slumpmässig avkastning i en Monte Carlo-simulering. Allt räknas i
          fasta priser, i dagens kronor, med svenska skatteregler.
        </p>
        <p>
          Börja i menyn <em>Börja här för att skapa en plan</em> högst upp i planeraren. När du sparar din plan sparas den
          bara i den här webbläsaren, och du kan exportera den som en fil och läsa in den igen. Ingenting skickas
          någonstans.
        </p>
        <p>
          Resultatet är en uppskattning och inget besked om din egen pension eller finansiell rådgivning. Din personliga
          prognos finns på minPension.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-pl-lang="en" lang="en" hidden class="mt-4 max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
        <p>
          The Retirement planner works out your finances year by year, from today to the end of your life: salary and
          tax, state pension and occupational pension, savings in an ISK and a capital insurance, spending and
          withdrawals from each account. You can compare scenarios and test the plan against random returns in a Monte
          Carlo simulation. Everything is calculated in constant prices, in today's kronor, with Swedish tax rules.
        </p>
        <p>
          Start in the menu <em>Begin here to create a plan</em> at the top of the planner. When you save your plan it is
          saved only in this browser, and you can export it as a file and load it again. Nothing is sent anywhere.
        </p>
        <p>
          The result is an estimate, not a statement of your own pension and not financial advice. Your personal
          forecast is on minPension.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var KEY = "pensionslyft.planner.lang";
      function stored() {
        try {
          return localStorage.getItem(KEY);
        } catch (e) {
          return null;
        }
      }
      function apply(lang) {
        lang = lang === "en" ? "en" : "sv";
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-planner-about] [data-pl-lang]").forEach(function (el) {
          el.hidden = el.getAttribute("data-pl-lang") !== lang;
        });
      }
      apply(stored());
      // The planner's own EN / SV buttons (same-origin frame) and the header's switch both move the text with them.
      function watchFrame() {
        var frame = document.querySelector("iframe");
        try {
          var doc = frame && frame.contentDocument;
          if (!doc || doc.__plAbout) return;
          doc.__plAbout = true;
          doc.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
            var b = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest(".lang-btn[data-lang]") : null;
            if (b) apply(b.getAttribute("data-lang"));
          });
        } catch (e) {
          /* the frame is not ready or not readable */
        }
      }
      var frame = document.querySelector("iframe");
      if (frame) frame.addEventListener("load", watchFrame);
      watchFrame();
      document.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
        var l = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest("[role=group] [data-lang-switch]") : null;
        if (l) setTimeout(function () { apply(stored() || l.getAttribute("data-lang-switch")); }, 0);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
